title: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: Every link that opens a case page, and what the page does with the ID it is given: find the request, load your earlier work, pick the tab.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: R-1042 is the one hand-written case. Every other case page is generated from its queue row or Dashboard request, so the numbers are consistent but the wording is a template. Many Case Manager ledger IDs (for example R-0903 under 'Ready to step down?') have no queue row or Dashboard request, so they end at 'Request not found'.
---
group gIn "Links that open a case page"
  start a1 "Queue: click the request ID"
  start a2 "Queue: click 'Open'"
  start a3 "Dashboard: click 'Open case' in a request drawer"
  start a4 "Case Manager › Active cases: click a row or its ID"
  start a5 "Case Manager › Reviews this week: click an ID under 'Ready to step down?'"
  start a6 "Case Manager › Reviews this week: click 'Open case' in a review drawer"
  start a7 "Eligibility & Benefits result: click 'Open case'"
  start a8 "Notification 'Approval chance updated'"
  start a9 "Type the address /authorizations/case/ID"
endgroup

process r0 "Case page reads the ID from the address"
decision d1 "Is the ID R-1042?"
process hand "Hand-written case\n9 requirements, 6 actions, chance 62% rising to 88%"
decision d2 "Is there a queue row for this ID, or for the Dashboard request it belongs to?"
process fq "Page is built from the queue row\nand from its Dashboard request when there is one"
decision d3 "Is there a Dashboard request with this ID or this case ID?"
process fr "Page is built from the Dashboard request\nDecided ones show their result and have nothing left to send"
process gen "Chance, actions, criteria, draft and checks are generated\nfrom the payer, level of care and chance"

screen nf "'Request not found'\n'There is no request with the ID X.'\n'Nothing to show here' · 'Check the ID, or open a request from the queue.'"
click bq "Click 'Back to queue' or the 'Authorizations' crumb"
goto gQ "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue › Open the queue and read the top"

store ld "Your earlier work on this case is loaded\nAnswers, applied and dismissed actions, focus, clinical context, draft edits, log"
decision d4 "Does ?tab= name one of the five tabs?"
screen tab1 "That tab opens\ne.g. a review drawer opens '?tab=draft'"
screen tab0 "'Recommended actions' opens"
goto gH "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Header and numbers"

a1 --> r0
a2 --> r0
a3 --> r0
a4 --> r0
a5 --> r0
a6 --> r0
a7 --> r0
a8 --> r0
a9 --> r0
r0 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| hand --> ld
d1 -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| fq --> gen
d2 -->|No| d3
d3 -->|Yes| fr --> gen
d3 -->|No| nf
nf --> bq --> gQ
gen --> ld
ld --> d4
d4 -->|Yes| tab1 --> gH
d4 -->|No or missing| tab0 --> gH
